        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a488"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts231" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts280">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE> I was. I didn't think that, like, when you tell me that that was how you felt, I would never have guessed because, you know. I played it cool. Yeah, you played it cool. You didn't notice me, Bright Red. Yeah, I just, I think I just thought there's completely out of my league.[ Oh, shut up] [laugh]. But yeah, I think as things progressed, it was just like exciting, but also like super scary because you were from Australia and I was from.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a491"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts298" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts306">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I think I'd say, like, like, whatever made you.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
